  "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Savitha Nagaraju</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Assistant Professor</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Interested Areas:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Machine Learning, Computer Vision, Deep Learning</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Education Details</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>M.S ,Intelligent Adaptive Systems, University of Hamburg, Germany</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>M.Tech, Digital Electronics and Communication, M.S.Ramaiah Institute of Technology, Bangalore</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>B.E Electronics and Communication, Sapthagiri College of Engineering,  VTU.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Professional Experience</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Assistant Professor, A T M E College of Engineering, Mysuru, July 2023 – Present.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Voluteering at ReDi Cyberschool-Teacher in Data Analytis, June 2022-July 2023</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>CRM Support , HomeToGo, Berlin ,July 2019--May 2020</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Project Support Officer , NXP Semiconductors, Hamburg ,June 2016--May 2019</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Student Assistant, University of Hamburg, March 2015--July 2016</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Business Intelligence System Engineer , Infosys Technologies Limited, Bangalore,Sep 2011-Sep 2014</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->",
